    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I haven’t used AI for math learning yet, but I’ve seen my grandchildren using educational apps with AI features. They seem helpful for step-by-step explanations and instant feedback. I’d be curious to try it myself, though I prefer traditional methods when possible.",
