    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize learning by adapting explanations to students’ skill levels. They’d provide instant feedback, making practice less intimidating. For older learners like me, they could bridge gaps between traditional teaching and modern tools, fostering curiosity without overwhelming complexity."
